{"title": "Ceremorphosis", "pageid": 44904, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ceremorphosis", "categories": ["Class actions", "Actions", "Bonus actions", "Reactions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">For the achievement, see <a href=\"/wiki/Achievements#Ceremorphosis\" title=\"Achievements\">Ceremorphosis</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ceremorphosis.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Ceremorphosis.webp/300px-Ceremorphosis.webp, /w/images/6/6e/Ceremorphosis.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6e/Ceremorphosis.webp/300px-Ceremorphosis.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6e/Ceremorphosis.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Ceremorphosis</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Class_action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Class action\">class action</a> used by some NPC's who are infected with tadpole.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nSubmit to the coaxing of the tadpole. Your very morphology will shift. The pain will be incredible. Once its over, you will be a mind flayer. Forever.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/42px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> + <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/28px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/42px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/28px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UIDs</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_MindFlayerForm</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_MindFlayerForm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_MindFlayerForm\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_END_MindFlayerFormCivilian</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_END_MindFlayerFormCivilian\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_END_MindFlayerFormCivilian\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div><code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_LOW_MindFlayerFormCivilian</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_LOW_MindFlayerFormCivilian\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_LOW_MindFlayerFormCivilian\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Mind_Flayer_Form\"> Condition: Mind Flayer Form </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Form_(Condition)\" title=\"Mind Flayer Form (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Mind_Flayer_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Mind_Flayer_Form_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Mind_Flayer_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Mind_Flayer_Form_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Mind_Flayer_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Mind_Flayer_Form_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mind Flayer Form\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Mind_Flayer_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Mind_Flayer_Form_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Mind_Flayer_Form_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Form_(Condition)\" title=\"Mind Flayer Form (Condition)\">Mind Flayer Form</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Permanent</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity has embraced ceremorphosis and become a mind flayer.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Servant_Asthena\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Servant Asthena\">Servant Asthena</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Tailor_Vhynce\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tailor Vhynce\">Tailor Vhynce</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Marie_Taylira\" title=\"Marie Taylira\">Marie Taylira</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Saer_Eleganza\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saer Eleganza\">Saer Eleganza</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Muttonchops_Dexon\" title=\"Muttonchops Dexon\">Muttonchops Dexon</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Zgorrellik\" title=\"Zgorrellik\">Zgorrellik</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Morrus_Pinfeather\" title=\"Morrus Pinfeather\">Morrus Pinfeather</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Dubos_Clodds\" title=\"Dubos Clodds\">Dubos Clodds</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Deeziks_Tormo\" title=\"Deeziks Tormo\">Deeziks Tormo</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a>, there are three sets of three infected civilians each who are transformed with this ability. One set is near the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png/20px-Waypoint_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png/30px-Waypoint_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png/40px-Waypoint_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Basilisk Gate\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png/20px-Waypoint_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Basilisk Gate waypoint, one set is north of the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png/20px-Waypoint_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png/30px-Waypoint_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png/40px-Waypoint_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Baldur's Gate\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png/20px-Waypoint_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Waypoint_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Baldur's Gate waypoint, and the last set is at the docks west of the <a href=\"/wiki/Blushing_Mermaid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Blushing Mermaid\">Blushing Mermaid</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li>Two civilians automatically use this if the party get too close to them in the <a href=\"/wiki/High_Hall\" title=\"High Hall\">High Hall</a> just before entering the courtyard.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-dec